@startuml Power wireing Diagram

(Lipo5S) --> (Fuse30A)
(Fuse30A) --> (VoltageMeter5S)
(VoltageMeter5S) --> (PowerManagementBoard)
(PowerManagementBoard) --> (PowerDistributionBoard)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (VESC)
(VESC) --> (BLDC-NEO)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (XT60toXT30 x3)
(XT60toXT30 x3) --> (C620 x3)
(C620 x3) --> (Wheels M3508)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (BucketArmHoldC610)
(BucketArmHoldC610) --> (BucketArmHold M2006)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (LoadingShiftC610)
(LoadingShiftC610) --> (LoadingShift M2006)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (LoadingRotateC610)
(LoadingRotateC610) --> (LoadingRotate M2006)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (HTMDv2.2c)
(HTMDv2.2c) --> (BucketArmHight MS-385PH)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (DeskArmC610)
(DeskArmC610) --> (DeskArmHookPos M2006)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (KNI-Servo)
(KNI-Servo) --> (DeskArmHold MG996R)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (KNI-Servo-LED)
(KNI-Servo-LED) --> (LED x3)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (TrinityDeviceController24V)
(TrinityDeviceController24V) --> (AirRauncher x3)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (C620 ESCHub)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (C610 ESCHub)
(PowerDistributionBoard) --> (VESC ESCHub)

(EMS SW) ..> (PowerManagementBoard) : Signal
(Remote EMS SW) ..> (RemoteEMSBoard) : Signal
(RemoteEMSBoard) ..> (PowerManagementBoard)

(Lipo4S) --> (LogicPowerManagementBoard)
(Lipo3S) --> (LogicPowerManagementBoard)
(LogicPowerManagementBoard) --> (Jetson)
(LogicPowerManagementBoard) --> (Mainboard)
(LogicPowerManagementBoard) --> (VoltageCovertorBoard)
(VoltageCovertorBoard) --> (MID-360S)
(Mainboard) ..> (C620 ESCHub)
(C620 ESCHub) ..> (C620 x3)
(Mainboard) ..> (C610 ESCHub)
(C610 ESCHub) ..> (BucketArmHoldC610)
(C610 ESCHub) ..> (LoadingShiftC610)
(C610 ESCHub) ..> (LoadingRotateC610)
(C610 ESCHub) ..> (DeskArmC610)
(Mainboard) ..> (VESC ESCHub)
(VESC ESCHub) ..> (VESC)
(Mainboard) ..> (HTMDv2.2c)
(Mainboard) ..> (KNI-Servo)
(Mainboard) ..> (KNI-Servo-LED)
(Mainboard) ..> (TrinityDeviceController24V)
(Mainboard) ..> (Jetson)
(Mainboard) ..> (PowerManagementBoard)
(Mainboard) ..> (VoltageCovertorBoard)
(Mainboard) ..> (RemoteEMSBoard)

@enduml